{"id":"steam-steam-4321390-1841579228666809","game_id":"steam-4321390","kind":"update","title":"The Last Opening - Demo Release Update","summary":"Development of The Last Opening is moving into its final stages, and we finally have some important dates to share.The demo will become available by the end of September 15th October.In October, The Last Opening will participate in Steam Next Fest, giving everyone a chance to play the game before release.The full release is currently planned for a few months after Next Fest.Over the past months we have been expanding the game, polishing its visuals, adding new encounters and events, and refining","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T20:51:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228666809","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4321390-1828894815559089","game_id":"steam-4321390","kind":"announcement","title":"The Last Opening","summary":"From the developers of Svarog's Dream, we present you a new RPG: The Last Opening.In this title, you face Death.Each night, you sit across from him and play a move of chess. Each move brings you closer to the end.During the day, you survive the cold, gather what little you can, and make choices that shape the board itself. The world and the chess game are not separate. They affect each other.There is no rush. Only time passing.What kind of game is this?The focus is on atmosphere, survival, and q","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-03T02:49:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815559089","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4321390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:19Z","status":"ok","a